234 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 173 0 R
/T (1. Baseline CNN: lightweight 2-block architecture used as a reference model. 2. Regularized CNN: BatchNorm and Dropout added to a 3-block convolutional architecture. 3. Augmented CNN: Regularized architecture enhanced with data augmentation during training. 4. Tuned CNN: Architecture optimized through hyperparameter search using Keras Tuner. 5. Transfer Learning: MobileNetV2 with frozen backbone, followed by selective fine-tuning.)
/E (1. Baseline CNN: lightweight 2-block architecture used as a reference model. 2. Regularized CNN: BatchNorm and Dropout added to a 3-block convolutional architecture. 3. Augmented CNN: Regularized architecture enhanced with data augmentation during training. 4. Tuned CNN: Architecture optimized through hyperparameter search using Keras Tuner. 5. Transfer Learning: MobileNetV2 with frozen backbone, followed by selective fine-tuning.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
