1096 0 obj
<<
/Title (1. Baseline CNN: lightweight 2-block architecture used as a reference model. 2. Regularized CNN: BatchNorm and Dropout added to a 3-block convolutional architecture. 3. Augmented CNN: Regularized architecture enhanced with data augmentation during training. 4. Tuned CNN: Architecture optimized through hyperparameter search using Keras Tuner. 5. Transfer Learning: MobileNetV2 with frozen backbone, followed by selective fine-tuning.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1092 0 R
/Next 1097 0 R
>>
endobj
1097 0 obj
<<
/Title (In particular, since Quick, Draw! sketches are sparse, minimal, and inconsistent across users, we adopted an incremental complexity strategy. We started from a lightweight baseline and progressively introduced regularization, augmentation, automated tuning, and transfer learning to find the right model capacity without overfitting.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1092 0 R
/Prev 1096 0 R
>>
endobj
